Maintainer: VEY-OSS Developers <developers@vey.oss>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), pkg-config, capnproto, cmake, g++
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://github.com/VEY-OSS/vey

Package: vey-statsd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: systemd
Description: StatsD metrics ingestion and export server
 Receives StatsD metrics over UDP or a Unix datagram socket, aggregates
 them, and exports to backends such as Graphite, Prometheus, InfluxDB,
 and VictoriaMetrics.
